{"elapsed": 566.21, "kind": "lore-verified", "id": "synagoga", "open": true, "text": "\u00d7\nThe words on the scroll\n\n\u05e9\u05de\u05e2 \u05d9\u05e9\u05e8\u05d0\u05dc \u05d9\u05d4\u05d5\u05d4 \u05d0\u05dc\u05d4\u05d9\u05e0\u05d5 \u05d9\u05d4\u05d5\u05d4 \u05d0\u05d7\u05d3\n\n\u201cHear, O Israel: the Lord our God, the Lord is one.\u201d The scroll lies open on its wooden rollers. The benches are worn smooth where the congregation gathers to listen.", "lang": "he", "dir": "rtl", "statusElements": 0, "sourceExposed": false, "uncertaintyLabel": false}
{"elapsed": 568.33, "kind": "lore-verified", "id": "triggioBurials", "open": true, "text": "\u00d7\nA name worn away\n\nHIC REQVIESCIT IN PACE\nORATE PRO EO\n\n\u201cHere he rests in peace. Pray for him.\u201d The name above has worn away. A small lamp rests beside the stone; the neighbouring graves are closed with heavy slabs.", "lang": "la", "dir": "ltr", "statusElements": 0, "sourceExposed": false, "uncertaintyLabel": false}
